Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:18.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:18.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}威爱愈卫！
