Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:25.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:29.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他究竟在盘算什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:34.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要多想 现在专心对付凶暴兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:43.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:45.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:46.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:50.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:53.18,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:00.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,僵持下去要挡不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:04.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:08.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:14.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,骑士反而被公主给保护了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要想办法应付那橡子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:25.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不要乱来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,她要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:36.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:44.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,护盾是无效的... 没长进的丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜呜... 好吓人...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怕 Butterfly会保护我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:18:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是最强的 永远都活力四射 温柔体贴...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的手非常温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:08.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:09.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对要保护大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:15.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我下定了决心要成为最强的保育员！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.19,0:18:17.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶扑击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Press！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
