Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:40.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.89,0:19:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:52.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你别再来小朋友们这里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:54.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 妈妈和奶奶来接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在想 蝶华老师还真是小蝴蝶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前当过保育员的 不记得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:20.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老师！居然还能见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听阿健说了你的名字 就在想难不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健真的受你照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:33.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 我还差得远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:36.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才也在阿健面前哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:40.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,想要成为老师这样的保育员 真的好难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有的事 沮丧了好几天的阿健 现在笑得有多灿烂啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你关心他 体贴他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.76,0:20:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对阿健来说 现在的小蝴蝶是比任何人都要优秀的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师 我会继续变得最最最强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:12.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 老师也不会输给阿健的 会变得更是最强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:16.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:35.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:35.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:45.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,神彩飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:45.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(790,970)}Wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:49.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,会出现什么呢？惊喜来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}蝴蝶愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:13.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起飞扬跳起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:47.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白 好小
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.06,0:23:51.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有过跟小空一样小的时候哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:54.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了！很久没去那个地方了 要不去一次？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.58,0:23:55.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也想去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:57.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,去你们俩回忆中的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:23:59.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:23:59.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.08,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人是好朋友♡ 回忆的大树！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:27.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:33.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:38.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:46.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:51.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:55.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:57.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:02:01.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:06.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:08.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:12.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:16.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:19.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:22.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:27.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:32.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:37.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:42.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:45.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:53.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
